<GlobalVariableEntities>
   <description></description>
   <name>Regression</name>
   <tag></tag>
   <defaultProfile>false</defaultProfile>
   <GlobalVariableEntity>
      <description></description>
      <initValue>''</initValue>
      <name>baseUrl</name>
      <protected>false</protected>
      <valueType>STRING</valueType>
   </GlobalVariableEntity>
   <GlobalVariableEntity>
      <description>Old registration UI, per SE-15096 (Regression env)</description>
      <initValue>'https://scienable-reg.aws.primerevenue.com/register/outlook'</initValue>
      <name>oldUiBaseUrl</name>
      <protected>false</protected>
      <valueType>STRING</valueType>
   </GlobalVariableEntity>
   <GlobalVariableEntity>
      <description></description>
      <initValue>''</initValue>
      <name>username</name>
      <protected>false</protected>
      <valueType>STRING</valueType>
   </GlobalVariableEntity>
   <GlobalVariableEntity>
      <description></description>
      <initValue>''</initValue>
      <name>password</name>
      <protected>true</protected>
      <valueType>STRING</valueType>
   </GlobalVariableEntity>
   <GlobalVariableEntity>
      <description>React iframe Portal shell (feature flag show-react-portal-poc), Regression env. Corrected 9/22/2026 — per the &quot;Portal Environments&quot; Confluence page (Portal Team space, actively maintained), the reg deployment URL is regression.primerevenue.com, not access-reg.primerevenue.com (that was a stale URL pulled from a 3-month-old bug ticket; the env was migrated off it per that page's completed DevOps checklist). Requires VPN/Tailscale to reach from outside the office network. NOT YET CONFIRMED LIVE — flagged by Danniecia 9/22 that the old URL didn't load; this replacement is unverified pending a real test.</description>
      <initValue>'https://regression.primerevenue.com'</initValue>
      <name>reactPortalBaseUrl</name>
      <protected>false</protected>
      <valueType>STRING</valueType>
   </GlobalVariableEntity>
   <GlobalVariableEntity>
      <description>Supplier account confirmed (PT-272, 6/17/2026) to exist in both SE and SS with a working SE&lt;->SS app-switch inside the shell — i.e. flag was ON for this account as of that date. Flag state may have drifted since; reconfirm with Lejla/PostHog before trusting a run.</description>
      <initValue>'gpm.scienable@gmail.com'</initValue>
      <name>ffOnSupplierEmail</name>
      <protected>false</protected>
      <valueType>STRING</valueType>
   </GlobalVariableEntity>
   <GlobalVariableEntity>
      <description>Password for ffOnSupplierEmail / ffOffSupplierEmail (same password per PT-266/PT-272 bug repro steps).</description>
      <initValue>'Prime109!'</initValue>
      <name>ffSupplierPassword</name>
      <protected>false</protected>
      <valueType>STRING</valueType>
   </GlobalVariableEntity>
   <GlobalVariableEntity>
      <description>Supplier account used in PT-266 (&quot;SE: FF off - Supplier is unable to login&quot;, resolved 6/17/2026) — had the flag OFF as of that bug report. Flag state may have drifted since; reconfirm with Lejla/PostHog before trusting a run.</description>
      <initValue>'supplier.scienable@gmail.com'</initValue>
      <name>ffOffSupplierEmail</name>
      <protected>false</protected>
      <valueType>STRING</valueType>
   </GlobalVariableEntity>
   <GlobalVariableEntity>
      <description>Smoke flow: set at runtime by TC_Smoke_01_SupplierRegistration (unique per run) and read by the later smoke steps. Only populated when the steps run together in the Smoke test suite.</description>
      <initValue>''</initValue>
      <name>smokeCompanyName</name>
      <protected>false</protected>
      <valueType>STRING</valueType>
   </GlobalVariableEntity>
   <GlobalVariableEntity>
      <description>Smoke flow: set at runtime by TC_Smoke_01_SupplierRegistration — a supplier.scienable+alias address unique per run.</description>
      <initValue>''</initValue>
      <name>smokeSupplierEmail</name>
      <protected>false</protected>
      <valueType>STRING</valueType>
   </GlobalVariableEntity>
   <GlobalVariableEntity>
      <description>Smoke flow GPM (SE-15100). gpm.scienable, confirmed by Danniecia 10/1/2026 as the Regression GPM (SE-15100 itself lists a QA-env GPM, sapnagpm1).</description>
      <initValue>'gpm.scienable@gmail.com'</initValue>
      <name>smokeGpmEmail</name>
      <protected>false</protected>
      <valueType>STRING</valueType>
   </GlobalVariableEntity>
   <GlobalVariableEntity>
      <description>Smoke flow GPM password. Set this yourself in Katalon's profile editor.</description>
      <initValue>''</initValue>
      <name>smokeGpmPassword</name>
      <protected>true</protected>
      <valueType>STRING</valueType>
   </GlobalVariableEntity>
   <GlobalVariableEntity>
      <description>Smoke flow: password the new supplier sets on the Change Password page (SE-15102 step 3). Set this yourself in Katalon's profile editor.</description>
      <initValue>''</initValue>
      <name>smokeSupplierPassword</name>
      <protected>true</protected>
      <valueType>STRING</valueType>
   </GlobalVariableEntity>
</GlobalVariableEntities>
